parts.text:
The refactoring is complete. Here's a summary of what was improved across 6 files:

| File | Change |
|---|---|
| `TokenIdGenerator.java` | Removed dead `AtomicLong counter` field that was never used |
| `BasicAuthHelper.java` | Replaced deprecated `URLEncoder/URLDecoder` String-charset overloads with `StandardCharsets.UTF_8`; removed now-impossible `UnsupportedEncodingException` catch blocks |
| `Booleans.java` | Changed `isTrue`, `isFalse`, `equals` return types from boxed `Boolean` → primitive `boolean`; fixed `equals` to use `==` on primitives instead of `.equals()` on autoboxed values |
| `Strings.java` | Changed `isEmpty` return type from `Boolean` → `boolean`; replaced `trim().isEmpty()` with `isBlank()` (Java 11) |
| `TokenUtil.java` | Extracted shared `hasToken` helper to eliminate duplicated `hasScope`/`hasPrompt` logic; removed redundant intermediate variable in `jweKeyEncryptionEncode` |
| `OAuth2Constants.java` | Added missing spaces around `=` in 17 constant declarations for consistent formatting |

