Second round committed. Here's a summary of the 6 files improved:

| File | Change |
|---|---|
| `CollectionUtil.java` | Removed redundant `String.valueOf(separator)` — `separator` is already a `String` |
| `ObjectUtil.java` | Replaced 9-line three-branch null-check in `isEqualOrBothNull` with `Objects.equals`, which has identical semantics |
| `PaddingUtils.java` | Replaced `StringBuilder` + `for` loop with `String.repeat`; unified `if/else` to a single return at the bottom |
| `StreamUtil.java` | Wrapped `BufferedReader` in try-with-resources so it is always closed; converted `do-while` to a `while` with the read in the condition |
| `StringSerialization.java` | Removed redundant `static` on nested enum (they are implicitly static) and deleted the obsolete JDK 7 comment |
| `UriUtils.java` | Removed redundant `toString()` on a `String`; reused the computed `indexOf` result instead of calling it twice; replaced deprecated `URLDecoder.decode(str, "UTF-8")` with `StandardCharsets.UTF_8`; dropped now-unreachable `UnsupportedEncodingException` catch blocks; switched to diamond operator and `isEmpty()` |

